# Tests & deployment

- New behavior should ship with focused tests when practical (backend pytest for API/telemetry logic; frontend tests for pure helpers like track lerp / teammate rules).
- Do not weaken or delete tests to make CI pass; fix the code or update tests with intent.
- The app runs as a Docker Compose stack (`docker compose up --build`). Deployment work should target container builds/pipelines, not only local `start.bat` Python/npm.
- Secrets (`PUBG_API_KEY`) stay in env / `backend/.env`, never in images or git.
